-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"constraints":"Read saved transfer status. running/verifying/paused/failed is pending and cannot be called success; poll transfers(id), do not invoke fetch/send again. Owner UI handles pause/resume/cancel. For verify-taken-file, id/to/size must come from the same saved direction=take transfer; compare SHA-256 to remote source if integrity matters.","options":["verify-done","pending"],"question":"Has the saved transfer completed with end-to-end SHA-256?"},"key":"copy-status","section":"judge"}
J copy-status verify-done|pending:"Has the saved transfer completed with end-to-end SHA-256?" -- Read saved transfer status. running/verifying/paused/failed is pending and cannot be called success; poll transfers(id), do not invoke fetch/send again. Owner UI handles pause/resume/cancel. For verify-taken-file, id/to/size must come from the same saved direction=take transfer; compare SHA-256 to remote source if integrity matters.
V J copy-status -> human:operator why:"explicit choice required"
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"constraints":"Default inbox is preferred. First model Send returns approval_required and owner must approve devices:send:<id>. A named writable share requires observed write:true/writeAnywhere; do not infer consent from pairing.","options":["send-inbox","stop"],"question":"Send to the paired PC inbox or defer until destination is clarified?"},"key":"send-destination","section":"judge"}
J send-destination send-inbox|stop:"Send to the paired PC inbox or defer until destination is clarified?" -- Default inbox is preferred. First model Send returns approval_required and owner must approve devices:send:<id>. A named writable share requires observed write:true/writeAnywhere; do not infer consent from pairing.
V J send-destination -> human:operator why:"explicit choice required"
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Unpaired/revoked token or PC unreachable","recovery":"Stop and name the device; owner pairs/unpairs or turns PC on through Accounts. Do not reconfigure network"},"key":"0","section":"pitfalls"}
X Unpaired/revoked token or PC unreachable -> Stop and name the device; owner pairs/unpairs or turns PC on through Accounts. Do not reconfigure network
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Destination collision changes name","recovery":"Use saved transfer.to; receiver chooses name (2).ext and never overwrites"},"key":"1","section":"pitfalls"}
X Destination collision changes name -> Use saved transfer.to; receiver chooses name (2).ext and never overwrites
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Send returns approval_required","recovery":"Owner approves exact peer scope; reconcile failed manual run, then begin a new reviewed procedure after grant"},"key":"2","section":"pitfalls"}
X Send returns approval_required -> Owner approves exact peer scope; reconcile failed manual run, then begin a new reviewed procedure after grant
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Source changes or hash/range mismatch while copying","recovery":"Inspect failed receipt/partial; do not claim complete; a new intent after source reconciliation is required"},"key":"3","section":"pitfalls"}
X Source changes or hash/range mismatch while copying -> Inspect failed receipt/partial; do not claim complete; a new intent after source reconciliation is required
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Backend restart pauses transfer","recovery":"Owner resumes from verified chunks; poll retained ID, never duplicate copy"},"key":"4","section":"pitfalls"}
X Backend restart pauses transfer -> Owner resumes from verified chunks; poll retained ID, never duplicate copy
-- @record {"chapter":"overview","data":{"failure":"Read UTF-8 range splits multibyte character","recovery":"Offsets are bytes and decoder replaces incomplete sequences; fetch full file for exact Unicode"},"key":"5","section":"pitfalls"}
X Read UTF-8 range splits multibyte character -> Offsets are bytes and decoder replaces incomplete sequences; fetch full file for exact Unicode
